  "label": "The Shiba Inu dog is mapped as expressing skepticism toward the text about humor standards",
  "description": "The visual entity 'Shiba_Inu_dog' with its skeptical expression is mapped onto the textual material 'text_chunk_1' and 'text_chunk_2' to convey disbelief or challenge toward the notion that humor should be equated with misogynistic content. The dog's expression (skepticism) is culturally understood to represent questioning, which directly interacts with the text to create the meme's core message. The spatial positioning of the dog centrally, with text above and below, reinforces this mapping.",
